Provides: flatpak-install-gui
Conflicts: flatpak-install-gui
Replaces: flatpak-install-gui
Description: Qt 6 and Kirigami installer for local Flatpak references
 Install Flatpak apps in a user or system installation with one action,
 authorizing required signed repositories with Install. Uses libflatpak
 and the session authorization agent without running the interface as root.
 .
 The interface is translated and follows the language of the KDE Plasma
 session. The legacy flatpak-install-gui command is kept as an alias.
